<!doctype html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="theme-color" content="#071b5b">
	<title><%= title %> | SAPPHIRE TECH</title>
	<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<style>
		:root {
			--sapphire: #1746ff;
			--deep: #071b5b;
			--ink: #101a35;
			--muted: #6b7692;
			--ice: #f3f6ff;
			--cyan: #45d9ff;
		}
		* { box-sizing: border-box; }
		body { font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; }
		a { text-decoration: none; }
		.topbar { background: var(--deep); color: #dce5ff; font-size: .82rem; }
		.navbar { background: #fff; }
		.brand-mark { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 39px; height: 39px; border-radius: 12px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--sapphire), #05b9f4); font-size: 1.2rem; }
		.brand-name { color: var(--deep); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .04em; }
		.nav-link { color: #53607e; font-weight: 400; }
		.nav-link:hover, .nav-link.active { color: var(--sapphire); }
		.hero { overflow: hidden; position: relative; color: #fff; background: radial-gradient(circle at 78% 45%, #2467ff 0, transparent 30%), linear-gradient(120deg, #061747, #0b2f99 62%, #1746ff); }
		.hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
		.eyebrow { color: var(--cyan); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 500; }
		.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.25rem); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; }
		.hero p { color: #d1dcff; max-width: 490px; }
		.hero-image { filter: drop-shadow(0 22px 35px #020a2d70); max-height: 380px; object-fit: contain; }
		.section-kicker { color: var(--sapphire); font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .12em; font-weight: 600; }
		.section-title { color: var(--deep); font-weight: 600; }
		.category-card { height: 100%; padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid #e8edfa; border-radius: 18px; transition: .2s ease; }
		.category-card:hover { border-color: #b6c7ff; transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 14px 32px #0e2e8110; }
		.category-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 52px; height: 52px; color: var(--sapphire); background: #edf2ff; border-radius: 15px; font-size: 1.45rem; }
		.category-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 500; }
		.category-card p, .text-muted-custom { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
		.product-card { height: 100%; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e9edf7; border-radius: 18px; transition: .2s ease; }
		.product-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 15px 32px #0e2e8114; }
		.product-photo { height: 205px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--ice); }
		.product-photo img { width: 78%; height: 78%; object-fit: contain; mix-blend-mode: multiply; }
		.product-card .card-body { padding: 1.2rem; }
		.badge-soft { color: var(--sapphire); background: #eaf0ff; font-weight: 400; }
		.price { color: var(--deep); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; }
		.stars { color: #ffb82e; font-size: .85rem; }
		.promo { background: linear-gradient(115deg, #071b5b, #1746ff); border-radius: 22px; color: white; }
		.promo p { color: #d5e0ff; }
		footer { background: #071431; color: #d7def3; }
		footer a { color: #b7c4e7; }
		footer a:hover { color: #fff; }
		.footer-title { color: #fff; font-weight: 500; }
		@media (max-width: 767.98px) { .hero-image { max-height: 260px; margin-top: 1rem; } .hero { text-align: center; } .hero p { margin-inline: auto; } }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="topbar py-2 d-none d-md-block">
		<div class="container d-flex justify-content-between">
			<span>🚚 ส่งฟรีเมื่อซื้อครบ 1,500 บาท</span>
			<span>ปรึกษาการจัดสเปกฟรี · โทร. 02-555-0199</span>
		</div>
	</div>
	<header>
		<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg py-3" aria-label="เมนูหลัก">
			<div class="container">
				<a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2" href="/" aria-label="Sapphire Tech หน้าแรก">
					<span class="brand-mark">✦</span><span class="brand-name">SAPPHIRE<span class="text-primary">TECH</span></span>
				</a>
				<button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav" aria-controls="mainNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="เปิดเมนู"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button>
				<div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav">
					<ul class="navbar-nav mx-auto gap-lg-3 my-3 my-lg-0">
						<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">หน้าแรก</a></li>
						<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/showProduct">หมวดหมู่สินค้า</a></li>
						<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/#popular">สินค้าขายดี</a></li>
						<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/product">สินค้าทั้งหมด</a></li>
						<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">เกี่ยวกับเรา</a></li>
					</ul>
					<a class="btn btn-primary rounded-pill px-4" href="/product">เลือกซื้อสินค้า</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>
	</header>
	<main>
		<%- body %>
	</main>
	<footer class="pt-4 pb-3 mt-5">
		<div class="container d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-3">
			<span>SAPPHIRE TECH · อุปกรณ์คอมพิวเตอร์สำหรับทุกเซ็ตอัป</span>
			<a href="/about">เกี่ยวกับเราและติดต่อเรา</a>
		</div>
	</footer>
	<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
